Pebble firmware for StonePi.

Display bring-up (real panel off via panel handle), AXP2101 unused-rail
shutdown, tickless idle / light-sleep guidance, the port.h seam, and the
PC LVGL simulator (sim/build.py, main_sim, port_sim, server.py tile stream)
are adapted from:

  The Badge — https://github.com/curisama/The-Badge
