  MIT License (see upstream LICENSE)

The phone-style multi-tap keypad (main/keypad.c) is adapted from Muse Gadget
muse_keypad.c:

  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Waveshare BSP / LVGL are pulled by the IDF Component Manager (or
sim/setup_sim.py for the PC build) per main/idf_component.yml.
